      "description": "This is a replica of the Plutonium implosion bomb that was dropped on the Japanese city of Nagasaki on 9 August 1945, killing 100,000+ people.\nThe war ended a few days later. \n\nTo this day there is controversy as to whether the two atomic bombs should have been dropped on the Japanese. I will not enter that discussion but will simply report the facts.",
